<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{imageError}}" class="note">部分图片暂时无法读取，请稍后刷新。商品和订单信息以文字为准。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取好物…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">重新读取</button><button class="text-button" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">前往我的</button></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><text class="eyebrow">TASTE OF A PLACE</text><text class="page-title">循着风土，遇见好物</text><text class="body-copy">先认识产地，再看看当地采购者挑选的特产。</text><view wx:for="{{regions}}" wx:key="id" class="region-card" data-page="region" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="go"><image binderror="imageFailed" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="region-copy"><text class="tag">{{item.preview ? '筹备示意' : '模拟产区'}}</text><text class="heading">{{item.name}}</text><text class="body-copy">{{item.description}}</text><text class="text-link">进入产区 →</text></view></view></view><view class="bottom-space"></view></view>
